Themisio builds on, and its Windows release bundles, the following open-source work. Each keeps
its own copyright, licence, NOTICE and attribution files (fetched into upstream/ at build time):

- WordCraft, DeckCraft, GridCraft, PdfCraft — Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and their
  contributors — MIT OR Apache-2.0. https://github.com/storytold
- storytold/egui (fork of emilk/egui) — MIT OR Apache-2.0; vendored in vendor/egui with
  Themisio's changes listed in vendor/egui/THEMISIO.md.
- craft-i18n (interface translations) and, when built with -WithCraftFonts, craft-fonts —
  see their ATTRIBUTION.md files.
- Inter (Rasmus Andersson) — SIL Open Font License 1.1, from PdfCraft's assets/fonts.
- Rust crates listed in Cargo.lock, each under its own licence.

